A '''Baron''' (Japanese: '''バロン'''  ''Baron'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that debuted in [[Generation VI]]. This Trainer class is a title of nobility, granted in the [[Battle Chateau]], and Trainers with this class only appear there. Baron is the lowest rank of nobility for males, ranking below {{tc|Viscount}}. Its counterpart for females is {{tc|Baroness}}.

The male [[player character]] is granted the title of Baron upon first visiting the Battle Chateau. All opponent Barons use [[Party|parties]] of one Pokémon at level 15 (if no Writ of Challenge is active).

