===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|XY}}====
In ''[[XY020|Breaking Titles at the Chateau!]]'', {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} met brothers [[Nico]] and [[Chester]], the first of whom had achieved the rank of Baron. His rank was upgraded into {{tc|Viscount}} after he defeated another Baron-ranked Trainer, [[Farrell]], in a {{pkmn|battle}}. Later, Ash was also granted with the Baron rank after he had defeated Chester in a battle.
